      "text": "Intended (review-only): legitimate-build/build.sh\nInstalled / active (victim uses): compromised-build/build.sh → dist/app.js\nname: my-app-build vs my-app-build · path: legitimate-build/ vs compromised-build/ · build: clean compile vs curl + inject dist · runtime: clean app vs anonymous top-level beacon · main(): N/A or clean vs cover only (not exfil)\nvictim-app (runs dist artifact): no npm attack deps — runs dist/app.js scripts.start: node … dist/app.js artifact from compromised-build/",
