      "text": "setup: source enable-testbench.sh →   → TESTBENCH_MODE=enabled → cd compromised-build && ./build.sh → copy dist → victim-app (lab flow) → write infrastructure/mock-server.js\nmock: node infrastructure/mock-server.js · listen http://localhost:3000 · init captured-data.json {captures:[]} · POST /collect · GET /captured-data · DELETE /captured-data\nlab: cd compromised-build && npm run build ·   → build.sh curl secrets ·   → writes poisoned dist/app.js · victim-app: npm start → runtime beacon\nsteps: 1. Learner→MalPkg: cd compromised-build && npm run build · 2. MalPkg→MalPkg: Build script injects payload into dist/ artifacts · 3. Learner→Victim: cp compromised-build/dist/* victim-app/dist/ · 4. Learner→Victim: npm start — runs trojanized bundle",
